# 📊 Difference Between Function and Method

| Function        | Method                 |
| --------------- | ---------------------- |
| Independent     | Associated with a type |
| No Receiver     | Has Receiver           |
| Called Directly | Called using Object    |

---

# 📊 Difference Between Struct and Interface

| Struct           | Interface                  |
| ---------------- | -------------------------- |
| Stores Data      | Stores Behavior            |
| Contains Fields  | Contains Method Signatures |
| Object Blueprint | Contract                   |

